    <string name="privacy_title">Jingdu TXT · Privacy and about</string>
    <string name="privacy_message">Version %1$s\n\nJingdu TXT processes selected TXT files, reading progress, bookmarks, and cleaning rules locally on your device. It has no accounts, ads, analytics, or cloud service, and requests no network or broad storage permissions.\n\nYou initiate imports and exports through the system file picker. Uninstalling the app also removes private book copies and reading data.\n\nRead aloud uses your selected system text-to-speech engine. Some system voices may require a network connection, and text handling is governed by that engine and its provider. Choose a voice marked offline for fully offline use.\n\nDuring testing, contact the test provider for feedback or deletion requests. A public privacy policy and support contact will be provided before release.</string>
